PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_Intro::
    .string "Welcome.\n"
    .string "I am WALLACE of the ELITE FOUR.\p"
    .string "The POKéMON of the water conceal\n"
    .string "countless mysteries and illusions.\p"
    .string "Through elegant training, they can\n"
    .string "overwhelm any opponent with a\l"
    .string "devastating tidal wave!\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}!\p"
    .string "Let me show you the magnificent\n"
    .string "illusions of water!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Ah, {PLAYER}!\n"
    .string "I am WALLACE of the ELITE FOUR.\p"
    .string "You have returned to witness the\n"
    .string "beauty of my WATER-type POKéMON.\p"
    .string "Their elegance has only grown since\n"
    .string "our last encounter.\p"
    .string "Come!\n"
    .string "Let us create another breathtaking\l"
    .string "spectacle together!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Bravo.\n"
    .string "I realize now your elegance is\l"
    .string "far superior to mine.$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Your victory was truly beautiful.\n"
    .string "Go forth and face your next\l"
    .string "challenge with that same grace.$"

